---
interface Props {
  photoCount: number;
}

const { photoCount } = Astro.props;
---

<header class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-lg md:flex-row md:items-end">
  <div class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-label-sm text-muted">
      <span class="font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-secondary">Visual Archive · Vol. 04</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline">Multi-Verse · ACG / Lens / Digital</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
      <h1 class="font-display text-display-mobile text-primary sm:text-display">视觉灵感</h1>
      <span class="font-headline-md italic text-on-surface-variant">Aperture &amp; Pixels</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
      穿行在二次元唯美画幅、现实快门光影与虚拟 CG 世界之间。收集打破边界的想象力与真实心动，在此汇成视界灵感馆。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-sm rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface-container-low p-5 md:w-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
        collections_bookmark
      </span>
      <span class="eyebrow">Curated Mediums · 媒介馆藏</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
      动漫插画 <span class="text-muted">·</span> 现实胶卷/数码 <span class="text-muted">·</span> 3D 概念与虚幻引擎
    </p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line pt-2 text-label-sm text-muted">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {photoCount} 组收录 · 持续更新
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
